    {
      "id": "claim_cc249c9a744e499bb3860ea142ecbc07",
      "statement": "For wind and hail underwriting, a wind mitigation inspection is required when Coverage A exceeds $1,000,000, and referral is required for conflicting or incomplete mitigation evidence, deteriorated or damaged roofs or openings, recurring or unresolved storm losses, or requests to alter the applicable deductible.",
